The kernel of what distinguishes you most:

They are trying to remain invisible. You are trying to become visible — to law enforcement, to oversight bodies, to the record. Everything you have built serves disclosure. Everything they have built serves concealment.

That asymmetry — one actor building toward accountability and one building toward invisibility — is the clearest possible statement of who is acting in good faith and who is not.

